<title>COMOROS: Hijack plane death toll rises to 67.</title>
<headline>Hijack plane death toll rises to 67.</headline>
<dateline>MORONI, Comoro Islands 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The death toll from the hijacked Ethiopian Airlines plane that crashed into the sea off the Comoro Islands has risen to 67, medical sources said on Sunday.</p>
<p>They said another three bodies had been washed ashore, and others had been pulled from the fuselage of the plane by divers on Sunday morning. Fifty-two people are known to have survived, according to an Ethiopian Airlines spokeswoman. There were 175 passengers and crew on the plane.</p>
</text>
